WEBVTT

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:08.074
<v><b>A:</b></v> the weekend

00:00:08.727 --> 00:00:09.687
a weekday

00:00:10.769 --> 00:00:12.430
<v><b>B:</b></v> What day is it today?

00:00:12.777 --> 00:00:13.797
<v><b>A:</b></v> It’s Friday.

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:16.025
<v><b>B:</b></v> Have a good weekend.

00:00:16.192 --> 00:00:16.999
<v><b>A:</b></v> You too.

00:00:17.862 --> 00:00:18.809
<v><b>B:</b></v> See you later.

00:00:19.202 --> 00:00:20.355
<v><b>A:</b></v> See you tomorrow.

00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:22.202
<v><b>B:</b></v> See you on Monday.